On Nov 5, 2010, at 4:02 AM, Saptarshi Guha wrote:

> Hello,
> 
> Suppose I have an R reference to a DataInputStream called dsi, how do
> I call the readFully(byte[] b) method?
> I tried this but both y and x are just zeroes
> 


... as expected. You pass a copy of x to Java so, clearly, it won't change x as readFully changes only the copy in Java. You probably meant something like:

x <- .jarray(raw(50))
# x is now in *Java* so it becomes mutable

foo$readFully(x)

# get the contents from Java to R
.jevalArray(x)

Cheers,
Simon




